{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Teams｜结构图\n持久编队层次与关键静态接缝；箭头标签说明持有、继承、数据或调用。\n[[Teams/结构|结构文档]] · [[计划_队伍与装配|设计与缺口]] · [[GGYGO_流程_队伍与装配.canvas|装配与终止流程]]\n创建者A已捕获/准备并真实交付；Creator只管未交付，Squad只管已交付原责任，Host关闭原绑定。\nGate58 Failed/exit6，无新DLL、未冒烟；完整创建/Logout/切人仍开放，C13不关闭。Boss只共用底层宿主。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1690,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "presets",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOSquadPresets\n输入：Index、FPrimaryAssetId[]（含空位）。\n`SetPresetMembers` → bool；超限拒绝，原名单不变。\n`ResolveActivePresetRoster(Out)` → 人数 / PawnData[]；超限0且不加载，输出空。\n`HandlePostLoad` → 保留超限旧数据，不截断。\n本地SaveGame；编辑后由调用方显式保存。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOPlayerState\n构造唯一Squad默认子对象。\n`GetSquadComponent()` → 实际队伍指针。\n登记核对此唯一实例，不接受第二组件。\nController / PlayerState双向身份及同World/Authority。",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOPlayerController\n`Possess(Pawn)` → Authority执行出战控制。\nSquad终止仅在原活动控制链仍匹配时请求`UnPossess`。\n`PostProcessInput(dt, bPaused)` → 当前ASC::ProcessAbilityInput。\n[[Input/结构|输入生命周期]]；完整切人GA退出 / 输入释放政策未接。",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "squad",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOSquadComponent\nPlayerState唯一队伍；Roster意图 / Slots成员 / ActiveSlotIndex出战。\n`SetRoster(Data[])` → bool；权威、未装配；终止后拒绝。\n`RegisterSlot(Slot)` → bool，仅借用。\nprivate friend GameMode：`RegisterCreatedSlot(Slot, OriginalCreatedPawn)` → 接原创建责任。\n新接收校验初始化 / 容量 / 连接与绑定；true不保证Possess。\n`SwitchToSlot(Index)` → 控制请求；外调后重检原对象与终止。\n`DestroySquad` / `EndPlay` / `OnComponentDestroyed` → 同一私有`ConsumeCreatedSlotResources`。\n先关闭名单 / 准入再外调；借用不Destroy；不持H / Context或写ActorInfo。\n[[Teams/结构|接口与终止契约]]",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 565,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 510,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterSlot\n`InitializeForPawnData(Data)` → Authority一次配置 / 授予。\n`IsPawnDataInitializationComplete()` → bool纯查询，GameMode准备与Squad新准入读取。\n仅PawnData非空 + 原授予循环完成；不保证全部配置 / 客户端Ready。\n`GetPawnData()`与继承ASC / Avatar getter → 绑定来源。\n继承`AttachAvatar(Pawn)`，void不保证接收；Squad验证绑定，不复制执行器。\n不持有队伍 / 输入状态。",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCombatantState\n持有ASC、基础属性和复制Avatar。\n`AttachAvatar` / `DetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn)` → 原绑定接口。\n`Destroyed` / `EndPlay` → Super前唯一`CloseAvatarBindingLifecycle`。\n消费原H / Context；ASC真实Clear，后继隔离；Busy / 失败保留。\nTeams只触发原Slot原生销毁，不复制解绑。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主接口与H3]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS]]",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\n`SetPawnData(Data)` → Authority注入Pawn配置。\n`InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, Owner)` → 本地绑定宿主。\n`GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent()` / `GetPawnData<T>()` → 缓存读回，非ASC所有者。\n`UninitializeAbilitySystem(ExpectedASC)` → 匹配才解绑。\n[[Character/结构|PawnExtension]] · [[Input/结构|Hero输入]]",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GameMode / Experience：原创建者与配置\n[[GameFeature/结构|原会话装配门禁]] · [[Teams/结构#GameMode 创建准备、交付与未交付责任（创建者 A）|完整类型 / 输入输出 / 失败契约]]。\n`SpawnSquadSlot(Context, PawnData, OutActors)` / `SpawnSquadMember(Context, PawnData, SpawnTransform, OutActors)` → native准备bool，false仍保留实际原产物。\n原Context / 同PC同步保护 / PawnData弱快照；native pre-spawn捕获原Actor，先全Slot再Pawn；原配置与原Extension严格读回。\n`AttachAvatar(Member)`后重检原资格；调用private `RegisterCreatedSlot(Slot, Member)`前移出原对，先消费真实bool再重检Context：true只归Squad，false归Creator回收。\nCreator唯一请求原Slot→原Pawn销毁；拒绝且仍活保留原字段并拒绝同PC新生成；Destroyed/EndPlay先GF Close再同一残留消费、再Super，不持H/Context。\n`Experience::IsDataValid(Context)`仅编辑期容量；非法保存回落 / 默认运行容量 / 出生点Identity / 整队政策 / Logout / 完整切人未闭合，C13开放。\nGate57旧DLL不含A；Gate58 Failed/exit6，无新DLL、未冒烟；A无成功统一编译或运行证据，资产 / 网络未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1530,
      "width": 1690,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "capacity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GGYGOSquad：容量词汇\n`IsMemberCountWithinCapacity(Count)` → bool。\nint32原始数量：0～4 true；负数 / 超限 false。\n仅校验，不截断、缓存或加载。\n0是否业务可用归调用方；唯一上限4。\nPresets / Squad / Experience共享规则。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "created",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Squad已交付原创建责任\n`CreatedSlotResources`：原Slot / OriginalCreatedPawn弱身份，index+serial比较，不复制。\n真实`RegisterCreatedSlot`先共同提交名单 / 责任；true不反交，不保证激活。\n不跟随当前Avatar / Owner，不是第二名单；借用不能升级。\n终止移出唯一已交付台账，仅原Slot后原Pawn请求Destroy。\n接受 / 失效 / 销毁中逐字段退休请求义务；不证明物理清理。\n拒绝存活原字段留原台账并诊断；最终未处理明确Error，无Tick / 自动重试。\n未交付原产物由GameMode负责，不进入本台账；C13开放。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
